5a0578cef915f07575"} {"question" "q-130904" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, to get the minor of ${d}_{51}$, we remove the $5$th row and $1$st column: \n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & -8 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ ∗ & 5 & 0 & 7 & 1 \\\\ ∗ & 0 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ ∗ & 0 & 6 & 8 & 3 \\\\ 11 & ∗ & ∗ & ∗ & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{51}=|\\begin{aligned}-8 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 7 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 6 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nNow, the cofactor of ${d}_{51}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{51} & =(-1)^{5+1}{M}_{51} \\\\  & ={M}_{51} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-8 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 7 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 6 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039717/state.json" "file_sha256" "f78f157f482ab848d5025aafc32945cdc87ee0cfdc68de5a0578cef915f07575"} {"question" "q-130904" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039717/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "079affb9679cf342141ab56f4aba9a7e48b2be1c797f70d41c4e589f5b75d13c"} {"question" "q-130904" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039717/state.json" "file_sha256" "f78f157f482ab848d5025aafc32945cdc87ee0cfdc68de5a0578cef915f07575"} {"question" "q-130904" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-|\\begin{aligned}-8 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 7 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 6 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|"] ["math" "-|\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & 0 & 7 \\\\ -1 & 0 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 6 & 8 \\\\ 11 & 3 & 0 & -9\\end{aligned}|"] ["math" "|\\begin{aligned}-5 & -8 & 2