\\\ 2 & 0 & 7 \\\\ -4 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039717/state.json" "file_sha256" "f78f157f482ab848d5025aafc32945cdc87ee0cfdc68de5a0578cef915f07575"} {"question" "q-42092" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039717/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "079affb9679cf342141ab56f4aba9a7e48b2be1c797f70d41c4e589f5b75d13c"} {"question" "q-42092" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039717/state.json" "file_sha256" "f78f157f482ab848d5025aafc32945cdc87ee0cfdc68de5a0578cef915f07575"} {"question" "q-42092" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 7 \\\\ -4 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|"] ["math" "-|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 7 \\\\ -4 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|"] ["math" "-|\\begin{aligned}6 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|"] ["math" "|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & -9 \\\\ -4 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|"] ["math" "|\\begin{aligned}2 & 5 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 3 & -9 \\\\ -4 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039717/state.json" "file_sha256" "f78f157f482ab848d5025aafc32945cdc87ee0cfdc68de5a0578cef915f07575"} {"question" "q-42092" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 7 \\\\ -4 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039717/state.json" "file_sha256" "f78f157f482ab848d5025aafc32945cdc87ee0cfdc68de5a0578cef915f07575"} {"question" "q-32793" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the cofactor of ${d}_{15}$ in \n$D=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & -3 & 4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 8 & -2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10 & 2\\end{aligned}].$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039717/state.json" "file_sha256" "f78f157f482ab848d5025aafc32945cdc87ee0cfdc68de5a0578cef915f07575"} {"question" "q-32793" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, to get the minor of ${d}_{15}$, we remove the $1$st row and $5$th column: \n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & ∗ & ∗ & ∗ & 2 \\\\ 0 & 8 & -2 & 0 & ∗ \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 & ∗ \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 & ∗ \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10 & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{15}=|\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the cofactor of ${d}_{15}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{15} & =(-1)^{1+5}{M}_{15} \\\\  & ={M}_{15} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039717/state.json" "file_sha256" "f78f157f482ab848d5025aafc32945cdc87ee0cfdc68de5a0578cef915f07575"} {"question" "q-32793" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039717/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "079affb9679cf342141ab56f4aba9a7e48b2be1c797f70d41c4e589f5b75d13c"} {"question" "q-32793" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-