"] [17592186120436 :question/answer-fields 17592186119091] [17592186120437 :question/problem "Find the minor of $q_{23}$ in\n\n$Q = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 9 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 8 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$."] [17592186120437 :question/answer-fields 17592186119097] [17592186120327 :question/problem "Find the cofactor of $a_{23}$ in\n\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -7 & 5 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 9 & 0 & 11 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$."] [17592186120327 :question/answer-fields 17592186118437] [17592186120328 :question/problem "Calculate the determinant of the matrix\n\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 0 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 4 & -1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 6 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$."] [17592186119522 :question/problem "What is the minor of $a_{13}$ in\n$\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 0 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$"] [17592186119522 :question/worked-solution "To get the minor of $a_{13}$, we remove the $1$st row and $3$rd column:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & ∗ & 2 & ∗ \\\\ 5 & 1 & ∗ & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & ∗ & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & ∗ & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}5 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 0\\end{vmatrix}\n$$"] [17592186119523 :question/problem "Find the cofactor of $d_{23}$ in\n$\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 & 3 & -6 \\\\ 7 & -3 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 8 & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$"] [17592186119523 :question/worked-solution "First, to get the minor of $d_{23}$, we remove the $2$nd row and $3$rd column:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 & ∗ & -6 \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & -2 & ∗ \\\\ 6 & 0 & ∗ & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & ∗ & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nNow, the cofactor of $d_{23}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nC_{23} &= (-1)^{2 + 3}M_{23} \\\\\n&=-M_{23} \\\\\n&= -\\begin{vmatrix}0 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0\\end{vmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186119524 :question/problem "Calculate the determinant of the matrix\n$\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 0 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$"] [17592186119524 :question/worked-solution "We use the cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ndet(A) &= a_{11}C_{11} + a_{12}C_{12} + a_{13}C_{13} + a_{14}C_{14} \\\\\n&= 0 \\cdot C_{11} + 0 \\cdot C_{12} + 2 \\cdot C_{13} + 0 \\cdot C_{14} \\\\\n&= 2C_{13} \\\\\n&= 2 \\cdot\\begin{vmatrix}∗ & ∗ & 2 & ∗ \\\\ 5 & 1 & ∗ & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & ∗ & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & ∗ & 0\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= 2(-1)^{1 + 3}\\begin{vmatrix}5 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 0\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= 2(5\\begin{vmatrix}6 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{vmatrix}- 1\\begin{vmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 0\\end{vmatrix}+ 0\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 6 \\\\ -6 & 3\\end{vmatrix}) \\\\\n&= 2(5(6 \\cdot 0 + 1 \\cdot 3) - (1 \\cdot 0 - (-1) \\cdot (-6)) + 0(1 \\cdot 3 - 6 \\cdot (-6))) \\\\\n&= 2(15 + 6 + 0) \\\\\n&= 2 \\cdot 21 \\\\\n&= 42\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"]] "immutable_answers" [17592186118438 17592186118439 17592186118440 17592186118441 17592186118442 17592186118444 17592186118445 17592186118446 17592186118447 17592186118448 17592186119092 17592186119093 17592186119094 17592186119095 17592186119096 17592186119098 17592186119099 17592186119100 17592186119101 17592186119102] "immutable_fields" [[17592186118437 :answer-field/correct] [17592186118437 :answer-field/id] [17592186118437 :answer-field/key] [17592186118437 :answer-field/type] [17592186118443 :answer-field/correct] [17592186118443 :answer-field/id] [17592186118443 :answer-field/key] [17592186118443 :answer-field/type] [17592186119091 :answer-field/correct] [17592186119091 :answer-field/id] [17592186119091 :answer-field/key] [17592186119091 :answer-field/type] [17592186119097 :answer-field/correct] [17592186119097 :answer-field/id] [17592186119097 :answer-field/key] [17592186119097 :answer-field/type]] "no_history" []}
